  "body": "Freshly updated and positioned within the iconic 160 Kepa Road building, this spacious 1–2 bedroom apartment captures sweeping views extending to the harbour and city skyline.\r\n\r\nOffering a generous 77m² floor area, the layout has been thoughtfully designed for comfortable modern living. The kitchen with integrated laundry space flows seamlessly into the light-filled open plan dining and living area, which opens out to a covered balcony - perfect for entertaining or relaxing while taking in the view.\r\n\r\nThe apartment offers two bedrooms and one bathroom, with the second bedroom conveniently positioned off the living area and featuring a wardrobe, making it equally suited as a home office, guest room or second bedroom.\r\n\r\nNew carpet, paint and curtains plus a secure off-street car park adds convenience. The building itself is well maintained and offers secure access for peace of mind.\r\n\r\nWith shops and public transport right at your doorstep, and parks, reserves, beaches, and popular dining spots just minutes away, the location is exceptionally convenient. You’re also within easy reach of the Orakei Basin and Auckland CBD. A smart choice for first home buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking lifestyle and location in one compelling package.",
